---
description: Unit test style for apps/web
globs: apps/web/**/*.test.ts
alwaysApply: false
---

# Unit tests

- `it("should return an empty array when games is empty", ...)`
- One `assert` per test.
- Structure: arrange → act → assert (blank lines OK; **no** Given/When/Then comments).
- Mock DB ports; never import `prisma` in `*.test.ts` for default unit tests.
- Integration/seed tests: separate file or `RUN_DB_TESTS=1` suite only.
- Skip redundant tests: extra `findMany` callCount when return value already fails if uncalled; duplicate non-integer cases; `every()` when result ids already prove filter.

Run: `cd apps/web && npm test`
